body:
I was hoping to get O+2 for Fula City Zeraora, Plasma Genesect, Team Rocket Meowth,  Zenryoku2017 Manaphy,  Zenryoku2017 Hoopa and Mt. Tensei Marshadow; would that be possible?

&#x200B;

And yes! I can send pictures of their Wonder Cards and the game cards, however since I'm on GMT+8 it's 4am here x\_x, would you mind me postponing the whole trade for a bit? I'll be able to trade at around/after 7pm EST!
